/*
 * Implements semantic validation and construction of parameter lists for
 * function calls in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Infer and validate argument types against function parameter types.
 *   - Perform memory-ownership verification for arguments.
 *   - Compute overload-resolution scoring contributions.
 *   - Reorder arguments according to named parameters.
 *   - Construct tuple arguments for parameters that consume multiple values.
 *   - Detect invalid named parameters and mismatched argument counts.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::call::params
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/call/params.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-25
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
